{"4424710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cryotank Rogue", "steam_appid": 4424710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4834970], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Adapt. Augment. Escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryotank Rogue is a brutal 2D twin-stick roguelike shooter set in a decaying cyberpunk world. Wake up in a forgotten underground facility and fight your way through procedurally generated levels filled with enemies, secrets, and powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. Every mistake is deadly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/159ee5b4558ddf1a0b5dc4e274ae9b09.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in chaotic, sideview twin-stick shooting where movement is survival. Dodge bullet storms, unleash devastating weapons, and carve your way through enemies using precise controls with mouse &amp; keyboard or gamepad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Augment Your Body</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/789f65020a56a162ee03dca6a4e18b5c.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install powerful augmentations that change both your abilities and appearance. Stack enough upgrades and transform from fragile human into a relentless machine of destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, Explore, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/d1c3ae5471b29faf52e4da007f9c7532.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, armor, and consumables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out unknown pills and needles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build on the fly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters in a world where death is permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Roguelike Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/7544b647348ff4b4ee1308ec647d5b45.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ruthless enemies, cyborgs, monsters, and bosses across multiple biomes. Death resets your run—but not your progress. Learn, adapt, and push further each time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Style &amp; Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/20ca50a96c2fa24a646ea0cbe5a04ac6.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty pixel art with modern lighting effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive combat with heavy screen shake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, chaos, and a worn-down dystopian world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Adapt. Augment. Escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cryotank Rogue is a brutal 2D twin-stick roguelike shooter set in a decaying cyberpunk world. Wake up in a forgotten underground facility and fight your way through procedurally generated levels filled with enemies, secrets, and powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. Every mistake is deadly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/159ee5b4558ddf1a0b5dc4e274ae9b09.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in chaotic, sideview twin-stick shooting where movement is survival. Dodge bullet storms, unleash devastating weapons, and carve your way through enemies using precise controls with mouse &amp; keyboard or gamepad.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Augment Your Body</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/789f65020a56a162ee03dca6a4e18b5c.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install powerful augmentations that change both your abilities and appearance. Stack enough upgrades and transform from fragile human into a relentless machine of destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, Explore, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/d1c3ae5471b29faf52e4da007f9c7532.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover weapons, armor, and consumables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out unknown pills and needles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build on the fly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters in a world where death is permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Roguelike Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/7544b647348ff4b4ee1308ec647d5b45.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ruthless enemies, cyborgs, monsters, and bosses across multiple biomes. Death resets your run—but not your progress. Learn, adapt, and push further each time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Style &amp; Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/extras/20ca50a96c2fa24a646ea0cbe5a04ac6.avif?t=1786373449\" width=1370 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gritty pixel art with modern lighting effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive combat with heavy screen shake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, chaos, and a worn-down dystopian world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Cryotank Rogue is a fast-paced 2D sideview twin-stick roguelike shooter set in a brutal cyberpunk apocalypse. Fight through procedurally generated levels, loot weapons and augments, and evolve into a deadly machine to survive permadeath runs.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/87ca5081dfffe4457baada1daf3389a139465d0b/header.jpg?t=1786373449", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/8a3a689a19d9f44a42bc13b6cfc626e2b9b8c793/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786373449", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4424710/8a3a689a19d9f44a42bc13b6cfc626e2b9b8c793/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786373449", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or Intel Core i5-10600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 or AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB avail